1d:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original country-offer comparison","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original country-offer comparison"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Reviewed example",{"scope":"col","children":"Reviewed example"}],["$","th","Deadline in country list",{"scope":"col","children":"Deadline in country list"}],["$","th","Decision on 23 Nov 2026",{"scope":"col","children":"Decision on 23 Nov 2026"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Pakistan"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"31 Oct 2026,23:59 Swiss local"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Published cutoff passed"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Indonesia"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"30 Nov 2026,23:59 Swiss local"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check all conditions before applying"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Another origin"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Use its own row"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Do not copy either example"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
1e:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Separate the research, PhD and art routes",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Separate the research, PhD and art routes"}],[["$","p","The federal overview focuses on early-career research and also describes a first artistic master’s route for selected countries. These are not a general scholarship for any taught master’s. The current FAQ says postdoctoral scholarships are no longer awarded from 2027/28.",{"children":"The federal overview focuses on early-career research and also describes a first artistic master’s route for selected countries. These are not a general scholarship for any taught master’s. The current FAQ says postdoctoral scholarships are no longer awarded from 2027/28."}],["$","p","Write the intended activity as a sentence: a defined research stay during an existing doctorate, a new PhD, or the specific artistic degree route. That sentence helps determine which eligibility and evidence page to read. A broad wish to study in Switzerland is not enough to choose a funding category, and a programme at a well-known institution does not establish that it fits this award.",{"children":"Write the intended activity as a sentence: a defined research stay during an existing doctorate, a new PhD, or the specific artistic degree route. That sentence helps determine which eligibility and evidence page to read. A broad wish to study in Switzerland is not enough to choose a funding category, and a programme at a well-known institution does not establish that it fits this award."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Build a host-evidence matrix around a real project",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a host-evidence matrix around a real project"}],[["$","p","A research application needs a Swiss academic supervisor who will support the project. Use the matrix below to prepare for that conversation. It is an original planning aid, not a model support letter for a professor to sign without assessing your work.",{"children":"A research application needs a Swiss academic supervisor who will support the project. Use the matrix below to prepare for that conversation. It is an original planning aid, not a model support letter for a professor to sign without assessing your work."}],["$","p","In a fictional environmental project, an applicant wants to compare measurement errors in a small dataset. The useful host connection might be a group’s published method and relevant infrastructure. Record exactly what you have read, what you can already do and which part still needs supervision. Do not claim laboratory access or a collaboration that has not been agreed.",{"children":"In a fictional environmental project, an applicant wants to compare measurement errors in a small dataset. The useful host connection might be a group’s published method and relevant infrastructure. Record exactly what you have read, what you can already do and which part still needs supervision. Do not claim laboratory access or a collaboration that has not been agreed."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original proposal-to-host evidence matrix","tabIndex":0,"children":"$L22"}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L23","$L24","$L25"]}]
